🔷 Project 3
Diffusion–Elasticity Coupling in a Lithium Particle (Battery-Style Problem)

This is highly industry-relevant (battery mechanics, swelling, chemo-mechanics).

We solve:

Governing equations

1️⃣    Diffusion (implicit Euler)

(𝑐^{𝑛+1} − 𝑐^𝑛) /Δ𝑡 = 𝐷 Δ𝑐^{𝑛+1}

2️⃣    Linear elasticity with eigenstrain

∇ ⋅𝜎 = 0
σ=λtr(ε(u)−βcI)I+2μ(ε(u)−βcI)

with:

ε(u)=(∇u+∇u^T)/2

We solve sequentially each timestep:

Solve diffusion

Solve elasticity with eigenstrain from updated concentration

🔷 Geometry

2D hyperball

Zero Neumann for diffusion

Fix one displacement DOF to remove rigid body motion

🔷 Finite Elements

Diffusion: FE_Q<2>(1)

Elasticity: FESystem(FE_Q<2>(1), dim)
